00:10:35.191 --> 00:10:36.955
have to win the youth,

00:10:36.955 --> 00:10:39.184
they need to make Snapchat feel like

00:10:39.184 --> 00:10:42.040
that person's older brother's app,

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.734
and this new thing is even cooler,

00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:46.754
and that's how you win, in my opinion.

00:10:46.754 --> 00:10:48.913
I think you have to under arbitrage,

00:10:48.913 --> 00:10:51.003
or build off of a utility,

00:10:51.003 --> 00:10:52.674
I think people don't recognize

00:10:52.674 --> 00:10:54.648
how much of a utility Instagram was.

00:10:54.648 --> 00:10:58.038
Instagram made everybody
better photographers.

00:10:58.038 --> 00:11:01.173
Which brought a huge,
huge group of people,

00:11:01.173 --> 00:11:03.193
and then it started getting social.

00:11:03.193 --> 00:11:04.423
So my two answers are:

00:11:04.423 --> 00:11:08.510
under arbitrage the 12,
13, 14, 15, 16-year-old,

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:11.737
or build a utility, that
starts as a utility,

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:14.663
builds a big base, and then flip it,

00:11:14.663 --> 00:11:18.924
and create the social
network underneath it.

00:11:18.924 --> 00:11:20.967
Yea, it was a good answer.

